<%- include('../partials/head', { motion: true }) %>
<% const price = course ? money(course.price_cents, course.currency) : null; %>
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero hero-light about-hero" data-hero>
    <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap about-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker" data-intro>About us</p>
        <h1 data-split>Food safety training that <em>holds up.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead" data-intro>THVFoodSafe, from The High Vault Security, helps people who handle food get certified properly. Study online at your own pace, take a supervised exam from home, and get a certificate an employer can trust and check in seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="about-mark" src="/img/logo-mark-red.svg" alt="" width="260" height="300" data-intro="card">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="split-head" data-reveal>
        <p class="kicker">Why we built it</p>
        <h2>A certificate should mean something.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <%- include('../partials/photo-slot', { slot: 'about-story', cls: 'mb-32' }) %>
        <p>Foodborne illness is preventable. The people who stop it are cooks, servers, dishwashers and owners who know a handful of rules and follow them every shift.</p>
        <p>Too much food safety training is either a long day in a classroom or a quick online quiz that anyone could pass for someone else. We wanted something better on both counts: training that fits around a working schedule, and a certificate that proves the person named on it actually did the work.</p>
        <p>That’s why the course is 100% online, and why the final exam is supervised. Every learner shows their ID and their room on camera, and a person reviews each passed exam before a certificate is issued.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split mb-48">
        <div class="split-head" data-reveal><p class="kicker">What we stand behind</p><h2>Four commitments</h2></div>
        <p class="lead mb-0" data-reveal>These are the standards we hold ourselves to, for every learner.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="commitments" data-reveal-stagger>
        <li><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'book' }) %><h3>Plain teaching</h3><p>Short chapters in plain language, built on Health Canada guidance, with a written lesson for every video.</p></li>
        <li><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'shield' }) %><h3>Honest certificates</h3><p>A proctored exam, an ID check and a human review before any certificate is issued, and public verification after.</p></li>
        <li><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'lock' }) %><h3>Respect for your privacy</h3><p>ID photos and exam recordings are encrypted, seen only by reviewers, and deleted on a fixed schedule.</p></li>
        <li><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'users' }) %><h3>Real support</h3><p>A person answers every email. Quote your learner ID and we’ll find your account straight away.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-white section-rule">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="split-head" data-reveal>
        <p class="kicker">100% online</p>
        <h2>Nothing to attend in person.</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="index-list" data-reveal-stagger>
        <li>Register online and start Module 1 straight away.</li>
        <li>Study on any device. Your progress saves as you go.</li>
        <li>Take the proctored final exam from home on your own computer.</li>
        <li>Download your certificate as a PDF once your exam is reviewed.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing dark">
    <div class="wrap closing-grid">
      <h2 data-split>Ready when you are.<%= price ? ` ${price}, everything included.` : '' %></h2>
      <div class="closing-actions" data-reveal>
        <a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" href="/register">Register now <%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'arrow', cls: 'icon arrow' }) %></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>">Contact us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
